        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-G2-ORB, Rock Ridge Sandcast Brass Beveled Trim Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rock Ridge Round Rose Towel Bar has a distressed look that gives it old world charm. This towel bar is easy to install as it comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. It has an oil rubbed bronze finish. Choose from the 18 inch, 24 inch, or 30 inch size.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/rock-ridge-beveled-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-g2-orb\"><b>Fusion PH-G2 Rock Ridge Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/beveled-trim-sandcast-brass-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-g2-orb\"><b>Fusion TR-G2 Rock Ridge Towel Ring</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/sandcast-brass-rock-ridge-robe-hook-fusion-rh-g2-orb\"><b>Fusion RH-G2 Rock Ridge Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Rock Ridge Sandcast Brass Scalloped Trim Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with the mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-G2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-G2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-G2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
